      <room>K.3.201</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Welcome! or Why do we meet here today</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Microkernel OS Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This short talk is intended as the opening talk of the entire devroom.&#xA;After a welcome greeting, I will briefly ponder about the motivation for&#xA;meeting together and attempt a basic quantitative comparison of&#xA;participating projects based on available project-metric data. The goal&#xA;of this quick comparison is to illustrate some apparent similarities and&#xA;differences between our projects, and to further support our common cause.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2381">Jakub Jermář</person>
      </persons>
